**Vitalis Project** is a comprehensive fitness and nutrition management platform that enables users to monitor their health, nutrition, workout routines and body metrics while collaborating with certified Personal Trainers and Dietitians through a modern web application.

Designed with scalability, maintainability and performance in mind, Vitalis combines a modern React-based frontend with a high-performance FastAPI backend and PostgreSQL cloud infrastructure.



### ✨ Features

### 👤 User Features

- 📊 Dashboard with personalized statistics
- 🥗 Diet program management
- 💪 Workout planning & tracking
- 💧 Daily water intake tracking
- ⚖️ BMI & BMR calculations
- 📈 Progress analytics & charts
- 📅 Daily activity monitoring
- 🎯 Goal tracking
- 👥 Expert subscription system
- 💬 Communication with Personal Trainers & Dietitians

---

### 🩺 Expert Panel

- Manage clients
- Create custom workout plans
- Create personalized diet plans
- Track client progress
- View health statistics
- Subscription management

---

### 🛡️ Admin Panel

- User management
- Expert approval system
- Content moderation
- Platform management
- Database administration
- System monitoring

---

### 🏗️ Tech Stack

### Frontend

| Technology | Purpose |
|------------|----------|
| Next.js (App Router) | Modern React Framework |
| React | Component-based UI |
| Tailwind CSS | Responsive Styling |
| TypeScript / JavaScript | Frontend Development |
| Lucide React | Icon Library |
| Recharts | Interactive Charts |

---

### Backend

| Technology | Purpose |
|------------|----------|
| FastAPI | REST API |
| Uvicorn | ASGI Server |
| Psycopg2 | PostgreSQL Driver |
| Pydantic | Data Validation |
| Python | Backend Language |

---

### Database & Infrastructure

| Technology | Purpose |
|------------|----------|
| PostgreSQL | Relational Database |
| Neon Database | Cloud PostgreSQL |
| Git | Version Control |
| GitHub | Source Code Hosting |

